## 3. User Flow

**New Visitor to Dashboard**

1.  A user visits the homepage (`/`). They see a clean landing page with a header, a dark mode toggle, and links to "Sign Up" and "Log In." ✅ **已实现**
2.  They click "Sign Up," fill in email and password, and submit. The form calls the Better Auth API route. On success, the user is redirected to `/dashboard`. ✅ **已实现**

**Returning User Experience**

1.  A returning user selects "Log In," enters credentials, and is authenticated via the same API route. ✅ **已实现**
2.  After login, they arrive at `/dashboard`: a layout with a left sidebar (links to Dashboard, Profile, Settings) and a main area showing a welcome message, recent activity, and placeholder cards. ✅ **已实现**
3.  The user can toggle dark/light mode at any time; their preference is saved and applied on subsequent visits. ✅ **已实现**

**Logged-in User on Homepage**

1.  When a logged-in user visits the homepage (`/`), they see a personalized welcome message with their name/email. ✅ **已实现**
2.  They see two buttons: "进入后台" (Enter Dashboard) and "退出登录" (Sign Out). ✅ **已实现**
3.  Clicking "进入后台" takes them to `/dashboard`. ✅ **已实现**
4.  Clicking "退出登录" signs them out and refreshes the page to show the login/register buttons. ✅ **已实现**

## 4. Core Features

*   **User Authentication** ✅ **已实现**\
    • Secure registration, login, logout, session handling (Better Auth).\
    • API routes under `/src/app/api/auth/[...all]/route.ts`.\
    • Session expiration set to 24 hours.\
    • Homepage login state check with dashboard entry and sign-out buttons.
*   **Database Integration** ✅ **已实现**\
    • Drizzle ORM + PostgreSQL.\
    • Pre-configured `auth` schema in `/src/db/schema/auth.ts`.\
    • Database migration scripts support.
*   **UI Component Library** ✅ **已实现**\
    • Complete shadcn/ui component library (40+ components) in `/src/components/ui`.\
    • Utility classes via Tailwind CSS v4.\
    • All components are properly typed and accessible.
*   **Dark Mode & Theming** ✅ **已实现**\
    • Theme toggle component (`ThemeToggle`), context hook (`ThemeProvider`), and cookie persistence via `next-themes`.\
    • Supports light, dark, and system modes.
*   **Routing & Layouts** ✅ **已实现**\
    • Next.js App Router with nested layouts: global (`/src/app/layout.tsx`), dashboard (`/src/app/dashboard/layout.tsx`).\
    • Login/register pages (`/src/app/sign-in`, `/src/app/sign-up`).\
    • Homepage with login state awareness (`/src/app/page.tsx`).
*   **One-Command Docker Setup** ✅ **已实现**\
    • `docker-compose.yml` for Next.js server and Postgres instance.\
    • `Dockerfile` with multi-stage build.\
    • `.env.example` for required environment variables.
*   **Feature Blueprint** ✅ **已实现**\
    • Complete `/src/app/dashboard/` directory with layout, homepage, and multiple feature pages.\
    • Example pages: analytics, projects, settings, team, reports, etc.\
    • Reusable components: sidebar, header, charts, data tables.

